OL,3,GNEWSAWar heroes awarded the VC
OL,4,Aremembered in ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven men from Doncaster who earned the
OL,7,Fhighest award for military valour, the
OL,8,FVictoria Cross (VC), are being
OL,9,Fremembered at a special event in the
OL,10,Fcity on Tuesday.
OL,12,FSix of them served in World War One in
OL,13,FFrance and the other in Belgium during
OL,14,FWorld War Two. Three of them were
OL,15,Fkilled in action.
OL,17,FThe ceremony is supporting the Victoria
OL,18,FCross Trust, which cleans and restores
OL,19,Fmilitary graves and memorials alongside
OL,20,Feducating the public.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
