OL,3,GNEWSAWar heroes awarded the VC
OL,4,Aremembered in ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeith Lumley, its chair of trustees,
OL,7,Fsaid: "There have only been 1,360 VCs
OL,8,Fawarded, so to have such a cluster in
OL,9,Fone small town, as it was, is hugely
OL,10,Fsignificant."
